@startuml dynamic-view
actor Admin
participant "React SPA" as Client
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "Operation lock" as Lock
participant "Browser camera" as BrowserCam
participant "LatestFrameCamera" as BackendCam
participant "Recognition provider" as Recognition
participant "Liveness detector" as Liveness
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "LED controller" as LED

== Authentication ==
Admin -> Client: Submit login/password
Client -> API: POST /api/login
API -> API: bcrypt verification + signed JWT
API --> Client: JWT or 401/429
Client -> API: Open /ws/recognize or /ws/enroll\nsubprotocols faceguard.jwt + bearer.<JWT>
alt missing, expired, or invalid JWT
  API --> Client: close 1008
else valid JWT
  API -> Lock: acquire with bounded timeout
  alt another operation owns camera pipeline
    API --> Client: operation_busy + close 1013
  else operation acquired
    API --> Client: accept WebSocket
  end
end

== Frame acquisition ==
alt CAMERA_SOURCE=browser
  Client -> BrowserCam: Capture JPEG only when no response is pending
  BrowserCam --> API: base64 JPEG over WebSocket
  API -> API: drain queued messages and decode newest
else CAMERA_SOURCE=backend
  API -> BackendCam: start one VideoCapture worker
  loop capture worker
    BackendCam -> BackendCam: replace latest frame (never append)
  end
  BackendCam --> API: newest sequence > last processed
end

== Normal recognition and liveness failure ==
API -> Recognition: extract_embedding(frame)
Recognition -> Liveness: analyze exact face crop
alt liveness says spoof
  Liveness --> Recognition: spoof
  Recognition --> API: status=spoof, no match
  API -> DB: log SPOOF_ATTEMPT
  API -> LED: red feedback
else live face
  Liveness --> Recognition: real
  Recognition --> API: normalized embedding + bbox
  API -> DB: fetch active employee embeddings
  DB --> API: permanent + in-window temporary identities
  alt similarity match
    API -> DB: log ACCESS_GRANTED
    API -> LED: blue feedback
    API --> Client: granted + bbox + exact dimensions/sequence/frame
  else no match after recognition threshold
    API -> DB: log ACCESS_DENIED
    API -> LED: red feedback
    API --> Client: denied + bbox + exact dimensions/sequence/frame
  end
end

== Enrollment and duplicate attempt ==
loop until 30 real samples
  API -> Recognition: liveness-check and extract sample
  Recognition --> API: embedding/status/bbox
  alt real sample
    API -> LED: all LEDs on
    API --> Client: progress + bbox + exact frame metadata
  else spoof
    API -> LED: red feedback
    API --> Client: spoof + bbox + exact frame metadata
  else bad face/angle
    API -> LED: yellow solid feedback
    API --> Client: look straight + bbox + exact frame metadata
  else no face
    API -> LED: all off
    API --> Client: no face + exact frame metadata
  end
end
API -> LED: registration complete; all LEDs hold 3 seconds
API --> Client: averaged normalized embedding
Client -> API: POST /api/employees + Bearer JWT
API -> DB: BEGIN; pg_advisory_xact_lock
API -> DB: read active stored embeddings and compare cosine similarity
alt duplicate exceeds 0.56 threshold
  API -> DB: ROLLBACK (no INSERT)
  API --> Client: HTTP 409 with existing employee name
else distinct face and name
  API -> DB: INSERT; COMMIT
  API --> Client: HTTP 200
end

== Stop, disconnect, or process shutdown ==
API -> BackendCam: stop/release if backend mode
API -> LED: cancel old generation; all off
API -> Lock: release
API -> API: on application shutdown cancel log cleanup task
API -> LED: close LEDs and pin factory
API -> DB: close threaded connection pool
@enduml
